WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.120
|||||\\\\\\\\\\\\\

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:43.220
Alchemy

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:43.220
Shower

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:47.900
20 years ago

00:01:04.380 --> 00:01:05.920
Madam...

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:11.970
I have to make Do Hwa mine

00:01:12.050 --> 00:01:14.680
If she gets pregnant, then the child is mine

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:24.730
Mister...

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:26.400
Where are you going, sir?

00:01:37.080 --> 00:01:38.790
I heard about Do Hwa

00:01:39.370 --> 00:01:41.000
We were just heading there

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:45.000
Why are you here and not at the funeral?

00:01:45.710 --> 00:01:48.750
I'm here because it's the only way to change his fate.

00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:09.320
What are you doing?

00:02:35.430 --> 00:02:37.340
What have you done?

00:02:37.430 --> 00:02:39.470
I closed his energy gates

00:02:40.310 --> 00:02:42.770
He won't be able to cast spells

00:02:45.940 --> 00:02:49.360
I forbid anyone to open this gate

00:02:47.340 --> 00:02:49.340
Project coordinator and editor: Ria_Lee

00:02:49.340 --> 00:02:51.340
Assistant coordinators: Sana, Martini

00:02:50.110 --> 00:02:54.110
How could you do this to your son?

00:02:51.340 --> 00:02:53.340
Typesetter translators: Ria_Lee, tommo

00:02:56.030 --> 00:02:57.240
With your son?

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:08.710
Why does he control my destiny?

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:12.210
Nobody thinks he's my real father anyway.

00:03:13.010 --> 00:03:14.170
I'll find someone

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:16.630
A teacher who will reveal my powers

00:03:16.720 --> 00:03:18.720
and teach you magic

00:03:19.680 --> 00:03:21.510
I'll find him myself

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:25.230
And then I'll take out this sword and split it in two

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:34.230
I changed 12 teachers, I was thrown out from everywhere

00:03:36.030 --> 00:03:39.450
And finally I found the one that will change my destiny

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:52.920
I understood everything in our first meeting

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:56.050
You are my teacher

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:10.480
You think there's something special about me

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:11.610
owner?

00:04:14.570 --> 00:04:16.440
I told you the eyes are beautiful

00:04:16.530 --> 00:04:18.860
Oh, sorry. Only eyes

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:23.030
The blue mark of the nomad is imprinted in them

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:26.700
There's a mark in my eyes

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:32.380
Will you fight with me?

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:34.170
It won't be difficult to kill you

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:36.050
But this is Sosnovy Bor

00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:38.220
You will be caught

00:04:50.730 --> 00:04:52.810
I'm trying to save you

00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:55.940
Stay with me - you won't get caught

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:12.120
How should you contact me if you want to lay low?

00:05:14.630 --> 00:05:15.920
"Master"

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:30.100
Chan Wook?

00:05:30.770 --> 00:05:31.980
Yes it's me

00:05:32.480 --> 00:05:33.940
Why are you here?

00:05:37.690 --> 00:05:38.730
Who is this?

00:05:40.110 --> 00:05:40.940
Oh, exactly

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:44.200
This is Moo Deok, my maid

00:05:46.830 --> 00:05:48.040
Moo Deok?

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:54.960
Yul, you scared her. Put down your sword

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:01.720
Moo Deok, are you okay?

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:05.640
Moo Deok?

00:06:08.100 --> 00:06:10.020
ok master

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:13.560
Uk?

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:15.270
Yes

00:06:16.610 --> 00:06:19.190
Why are you here?

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:22.820
I came to the head. Heard a fight and hid here

00:06:23.530 --> 00:06:26.320
There were mercenaries there, but you can't fight

00:06:26.410 --> 00:06:29.280
You're lucky you didn't get caught

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:30.830
No really...

00:06:30.910 --> 00:06:33.250
Well done for hiding

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:36.540
My maid ran, and I followed her, you...

00:06:36.630 --> 00:06:37.880
It hurts...

00:06:38.630 --> 00:06:40.340
Who is this?

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:46.720
And what kind of knife?

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:54.270
You...

00:06:57.480 --> 00:06:59.400
tried to protect him with it?

00:07:00.360 --> 00:07:02.150
I'm proud of you

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:05.530
That's right. Your owner is still a weakling,

00:07:05.610 --> 00:07:07.530
he must be protected

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:10.870
Yes

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:13.160
I will protect my master

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:16.500
No. No thanks

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:20.540
I'm the one who should protect you

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:23.340
What a grip...

00:07:24.090 --> 00:07:25.170
Let go

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:36.770
Hey Moo Deok, don't look like that!

00:07:37.480 --> 00:07:38.690
Look down

00:07:41.190 --> 00:07:43.570
Yes, master

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:47.110
So you were the one running away from me

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:48.530
Moo Deok, right?

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:50.990
Sorry for scaring you

00:08:03.300 --> 00:08:04.880
Are you hurt?

00:08:17.730 --> 00:08:18.770
Moo Deok...

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:22.150
I'm fine master

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:27.240
- Has everything calmed down?
- No

00:08:27.320 --> 00:08:28.490
Everyone is still panicking

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:31.030
The body of the nomad Nak Su is missing

00:08:32.370 --> 00:08:34.990
As I thought, Dan Zhu's people

00:08:35.080 --> 00:08:37.700
Now all I have to do is get out of here alive

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:40.170
What a pity

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:42.170
Nomad

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:44.290
Mercenary Nak Soo

00:08:45.550 --> 00:08:49.090
I always wondered what she looked like

00:08:51.220 --> 00:08:53.510
He knows who I am

00:08:53.600 --> 00:08:55.850
We need to kill him before leaving.

00:09:00.480 --> 00:09:03.560
They apparently broke the barrier and escaped

00:09:16.870 --> 00:09:18.660
So the barrier is broken

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:21.080
- We're behind them
- It's too late

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:25.130
The barrier can only be broken using boron

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:28.000
There's a traitor among us

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:31.930
We need to ask the Jin family for help.

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:41.690
Nak Soo's body was in the secret room

00:09:42.770 --> 00:09:46.190
Uk, did you see anything strange while you were hiding?

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:47.820
Strange?

00:09:47.900 --> 00:09:50.650
No. I was just watching Moo Deok

00:09:55.120 --> 00:09:58.660
Do you think Nak Soo's soul moved into another girl's body?

00:09:58.740 --> 00:10:00.160
and that's why she came for her body?

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:06.460
Girls can only move into girls?

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:07.670
Not really

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:11.340
But in order for everything to go smoothly, they choose people like themselves

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:14.220
Gender, age and body type. Everything should be the same

00:10:16.140 --> 00:10:17.720
I'm asking because I haven't seen her.

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:21.850
Was Nak Su thin and short?

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:24.600
With a round face like Moo Deok?

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:26.520
What's wrong with him?

00:10:29.110 --> 00:10:32.650
In that case, her name wouldn't be "Nak Su"

00:10:32.740 --> 00:10:33.610
Look at her

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:37.160
What mercenary would look so cute?

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:39.030
Exactly

00:10:39.120 --> 00:10:41.370
I think she's a monster

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:43.620
No. She's a human

00:10:45.500 --> 00:10:48.540
Let's not speak badly about the deceased, even though she was a murderer

00:10:54.470 --> 00:10:56.510
Master Ho Yeom wants to see you

00:10:56.590 --> 00:10:58.550
Go without me. He still doesn't like me

00:10:58.640 --> 00:11:00.350
Exactly. Stay here, it's safer

00:11:00.430 --> 00:11:01.600
Let's go

00:11:13.070 --> 00:11:14.820
The body was frozen here

00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:18.700
There is no smell of rot, which means your body is fine

00:11:20.660 --> 00:11:21.700
Nak Soo

00:11:23.330 --> 00:11:24.500
Yes

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:27.670
I'm a hitman

00:11:30.380 --> 00:11:31.670
Nak Soo

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:38.590
I tried for a long time to understand why you helped me

00:11:40.850 --> 00:11:42.680
Did Dan Zhu send you too?

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:45.180
No, no one sent me

00:11:45.270 --> 00:11:47.190
Then why did you help me?

00:11:47.270 --> 00:11:50.650
I told you, but apparently you didn’t get it

00:11:53.400 --> 00:11:54.730
You have beautiful eyes

00:11:55.490 --> 00:11:56.740
Don't say

00:11:58.030 --> 00:11:59.280
that I fell in love

00:12:01.570 --> 00:12:02.620
Don't laugh

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:05.370
I still don't see any other reasons

00:12:05.450 --> 00:12:07.370
I admit, I've called you beautiful more than once

00:12:08.370 --> 00:12:10.210
But only because he pursued his goals

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:12.000
And what?

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:16.970
I was looking for a teacher who would break the spell and teach me magic

00:12:17.760 --> 00:12:19.220
And I found you

00:12:21.220 --> 00:12:22.300
Nak Soo

00:12:23.100 --> 00:12:25.060
Be my master

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:42.120
I heard

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:44.240
you borrowed the spirit of the Sapsari* of the Jin family

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:44.240
*shaggy dog of the South Korean breed, it is believed that these dogs are able to drive out evil spirits

00:12:44.330 --> 00:12:45.290
Yes

00:12:45.870 --> 00:12:49.330
Are you sure she's in Sosnovy Bor?

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:50.500
Yes

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:55.250
The nomad is hiding around here somewhere

00:12:59.720 --> 00:13:01.720
Son of Chang Gan from Sosnovy Bor

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:04.260
asks a killer to become a mentor?

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:07.680
That's bullshit

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:12.810
You will open the gates of your student's energy and help him master spells

00:13:13.400 --> 00:13:16.230
As your student I will help you hide

00:13:16.320 --> 00:13:19.650
We will have a wonderful relationship that will benefit both of us.

00:13:19.740 --> 00:13:21.610
- Not interested
- Don't you want to be my master?

00:13:21.700 --> 00:13:23.410
you can be a wife

00:13:23.490 --> 00:13:24.780
- Do you agree?
- Shut up

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:28.410
I heard you went to a bunch of teachers and they all rejected you

00:13:28.490 --> 00:13:30.460
Is it because of a lousy character?

00:13:34.420 --> 00:13:37.750
I couldn't threaten the previous masters, they had no weaknesses

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:42.090
But you have

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:47.640
You won't be able to leave this place without my help.

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:50.310
You will die if they reveal you

00:13:51.230 --> 00:13:52.350
How's that?

00:13:53.190 --> 00:13:54.650
In that case,

00:13:58.070 --> 00:13:59.400
I'll just kill you

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:04.780
How merciless. Still, I helped you

00:14:04.860 --> 00:14:07.830
Sorry for being merciless, despite your pretty face

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:19.340
I brought you to my home with a jade ornament,

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:22.050
and it’s even easier here

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:24.930
And look where we are

00:14:32.730 --> 00:14:34.310
This is the secret room of Sosnovy Bor

00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:38.730
Once the doors are closed, they can only be opened from the outside

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:41.570
We're locked in here together

00:14:43.820 --> 00:14:44.990
Don't move!

00:14:45.490 --> 00:14:48.070
Step on the wrong slab and the floor will fall through.

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:55.500
Kill me and you will be killed by the magicians who come here

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:58.960
But if you agree, we will leave unharmed

00:15:02.380 --> 00:15:05.470
I don't have the strength to destroy these gates right now

00:15:05.970 --> 00:15:07.840
He'll understand everything if I stay here

00:15:08.430 --> 00:15:09.470
I need my sword

00:15:10.850 --> 00:15:12.810
I'm weak because I migrated to another body

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:15.730
I need my sword with energy to unleash your power

00:15:16.270 --> 00:15:17.440
Without him

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:20.730
I can't do anything

00:15:21.860 --> 00:15:23.320
And to get the sword,

00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:25.900
I need to go out

00:15:25.990 --> 00:15:27.110
Stop it

00:15:29.370 --> 00:15:30.660
Don't you hear?

00:15:30.740 --> 00:15:33.830
I can't. We have to wait until they close completely

00:15:35.500 --> 00:15:37.670
You! You lied to me!

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:42.000
Don't move!

00:15:42.090 --> 00:15:44.260
- The floor will fail otherwise!
- Wait...

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:48.970
Hold on tight. You'll fall

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:52.470
-Where are you pointing your nose?
- Shut up!

00:15:52.560 --> 00:15:54.270
- Hey!
- You!

00:15:54.350 --> 00:15:55.310
Shit...

00:15:56.060 --> 00:15:58.730
- It hurts!
- I didn't do it on purpose

00:15:58.810 --> 00:16:00.940
- It hurts
- Wait

00:16:01.520 --> 00:16:02.400
Let go

00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:10.450
How will we find your sword?

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:13.330
I know who took it. I'll find him

00:16:14.620 --> 00:16:16.540
It is dangerous to leave Sosnovy Bor

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:18.250
We need to stay here

00:16:19.540 --> 00:16:21.460
Do you really need that sword?

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:23.340
Take another energy sword and finish the job

00:16:23.420 --> 00:16:25.550
I can't. The sword must be mine

00:16:26.800 --> 00:16:28.300
Let's go out and find him

00:16:29.260 --> 00:16:32.390
I'll lure him out and then kill him

00:16:33.720 --> 00:16:35.470
You said you were weak

00:16:38.480 --> 00:16:40.730
I thought you were pretending

00:16:42.110 --> 00:16:43.270
How weak are you?

00:16:46.360 --> 00:16:47.780
The magicians are coming

00:16:47.860 --> 00:16:48.900
Stay alert

00:16:51.780 --> 00:16:54.740
Why? They're on my side

00:16:56.240 --> 00:16:58.750
On your side? How childish!

00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:00.670
Why are you talking to me so casually?

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:01.960
Okay, master

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:03.290
I'll look at the floor

00:17:12.430 --> 00:17:13.470
Who is this?

00:17:14.260 --> 00:17:17.310
I am Moo Deok, his maid

00:17:19.810 --> 00:17:21.810
Did you hear? My maid

00:17:22.400 --> 00:17:24.110
You are clearly busy. Go about your business

00:17:24.190 --> 00:17:26.610
- Let's go, Moo Deok
- You can't leave

00:17:29.280 --> 00:17:32.280
The head said to gather everyone in the training room

00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:36.030
I am not a student of Sosnovy Bor

00:17:36.120 --> 00:17:38.370
The head wants to gather all living things in that hall,

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:41.250
what is in this forest

00:17:49.840 --> 00:17:51.340
- Uk
- Hey

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:55.680
What's going on? Why were we gathered here?

00:17:56.220 --> 00:17:58.850
They want to catch Nak Soo's people

00:18:01.020 --> 00:18:02.270
Nak Soo?

00:18:13.030 --> 00:18:14.240
Some of you

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:17.200
helped Nak Su's people get here today

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:19.040
Head,

00:18:19.120 --> 00:18:22.290
everyone here knows each other

00:18:22.370 --> 00:18:26.000
Outwardly, you are all followers of Sosnovy Bor

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:30.170
So I asked for help

00:18:31.380 --> 00:18:34.630
Mrs. Jin Cho Young brought Gwiga

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:11.340
you have arrived

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:27.440
Why is Chan Wook here?

00:19:28.520 --> 00:19:29.560
I don't know

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:43.160
And this is probably Gwigu, a relic of the Jin family

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:44.290
Gwiga?

00:19:44.870 --> 00:19:46.160
- Dog?
- Yes

00:19:46.250 --> 00:19:48.960
It is the Sapsari spirit that defines magic

00:19:53.550 --> 00:19:54.670
Among us

00:19:55.760 --> 00:19:57.010
nomad

00:19:58.470 --> 00:20:02.560
And Gwigu will find him

00:20:03.220 --> 00:20:05.850
Outwardly it's someone we know

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:09.310
And Gwigu will find someone who has a different soul

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:17.240
Close all the doors

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:18.200
- Yes
- Yes

00:20:22.990 --> 00:20:27.330
Anyone who tries to leave this building

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:30.670
will immediately be recognized as a traitor and killed

00:20:32.130 --> 00:20:33.250
Get started

00:21:34.520 --> 00:21:38.030
Alchemy of souls, a type of magic. But there is one minus

00:21:38.110 --> 00:21:40.070
A crack is created between soul and body,

00:21:40.150 --> 00:21:42.570
from which evil energy seeps

00:21:42.660 --> 00:21:45.030
And Gwigu can determine this

00:22:13.770 --> 00:22:16.770
Chan Wook, if I get caught, pretend you don't know anything

00:22:19.190 --> 00:22:21.320
- Is your loyalty?
- My duty

00:22:27.490 --> 00:22:29.950
I don't want to become a laughing stock

00:22:30.620 --> 00:22:32.580
when they find out that I asked for your help

00:22:32.660 --> 00:22:34.170
Stand next to me

00:22:35.330 --> 00:22:39.000
No one here will allow this beast to attack me.

00:23:10.120 --> 00:23:11.490
Nomad! Catch him!

00:24:40.120 --> 00:24:43.210
I heard that nomads turn to stone when they run wild and lose energy

00:24:43.290 --> 00:24:44.500
It was true

00:25:13.070 --> 00:25:15.530
We thank you for your help

00:25:16.910 --> 00:25:19.160
I'm sure the day will come when we will ask for help

00:25:20.330 --> 00:25:24.920
All four great Daeho families are gathered here.

00:25:25.000 --> 00:25:27.090
I heard they call you the Four Seasons

00:25:27.670 --> 00:25:30.840
I see you all together and my soul rejoices

00:25:31.590 --> 00:25:33.300
We used to get together often

00:25:33.390 --> 00:25:36.600
but this is the first meeting after Wook and Jo Young's engagement ended

00:25:38.100 --> 00:25:39.480
Scoundrel...

00:25:40.060 --> 00:25:42.520
I asked for tea

00:25:42.600 --> 00:25:43.810
Let's go

00:25:50.490 --> 00:25:52.280
You were here too

00:25:52.990 --> 00:25:55.070
I heard you were expelled from Kisan

00:25:55.160 --> 00:25:56.700
Yes

00:25:57.620 --> 00:26:00.410
Stop watching my every move

00:26:03.170 --> 00:26:06.090
Everyone was talking about how you were thrown out again

00:26:06.170 --> 00:26:07.710
I just heard

00:26:07.800 --> 00:26:09.130
I see

00:26:10.170 --> 00:26:13.050
Our dear guest does not like my company,

00:26:13.130 --> 00:26:14.510
and for this...

00:26:17.970 --> 00:26:19.220
Scoundrel

00:26:21.100 --> 00:26:22.140
Let's go

00:26:24.350 --> 00:26:25.440
Let's go

00:26:37.450 --> 00:26:39.870
Hey, there... you...

00:26:40.950 --> 00:26:42.910
Have you seen my maid?

00:26:43.500 --> 00:26:46.130
So short, with a round face

00:26:46.210 --> 00:26:47.500
Damn

00:26:48.380 --> 00:26:50.000
Where did she go?

00:26:51.760 --> 00:26:54.840
Dan Zhu sent a nomad here

00:26:56.510 --> 00:26:58.180
We need to find Dan Zhu

00:27:09.310 --> 00:27:11.730
Not loyalty, but duty

00:27:12.320 --> 00:27:14.240
Would you say that in this case?

00:27:15.320 --> 00:27:17.740
That's why I'm leaving, leaving you behind

00:27:17.820 --> 00:27:20.240
I was originally going to lure you out and kill you.

00:27:20.330 --> 00:27:21.290
I see

00:27:22.080 --> 00:27:23.450
Sinister

00:27:23.540 --> 00:27:27.210
I'm not your faithful chubby maid Moo Deok

00:27:28.130 --> 00:27:31.090
You are Nak Soo. Merciless killer

00:27:33.760 --> 00:27:36.510
You had the opportunity to kill me in the bathroom

00:27:36.590 --> 00:27:38.800
I risked my life bringing you here

00:27:40.050 --> 00:27:42.180
It's up to you to decide: kill me anyway

00:27:42.260 --> 00:27:45.230
or become a mentor, revealing my strengths

00:27:50.650 --> 00:27:54.820
You have a habit of staring at people

00:27:54.900 --> 00:27:57.150
Keep it up and you'll get caught quickly.

00:27:58.280 --> 00:28:00.450
Do you see the mark from there?

00:28:01.870 --> 00:28:02.910
No

00:28:05.830 --> 00:28:06.790
And now?

00:28:09.630 --> 00:28:11.040
I see because I know

00:28:13.050 --> 00:28:14.170
And now?

00:28:21.600 --> 00:28:23.310
I see clearly

00:28:23.390 --> 00:28:26.060
But you're unlikely to stand so close to someone else

00:28:26.730 --> 00:28:28.600
Be careful when kissing someone

00:28:30.940 --> 00:28:32.820
Come on, I'll help you get out

00:28:32.900 --> 00:28:35.360
Anyone who comes that close will die

00:28:37.860 --> 00:28:39.240
You might die today

00:28:40.610 --> 00:28:41.820
Spirit of Sapsari

00:28:49.330 --> 00:28:50.790
If he attacks you,

00:28:50.870 --> 00:28:52.670
will you turn to stone?

00:28:54.590 --> 00:28:55.710
Run

00:28:57.840 --> 00:28:58.920
I'll try to save you

00:30:21.760 --> 00:30:23.380
Gwig's Urn

00:30:23.470 --> 00:30:25.590
It was our family heirloom

00:30:26.890 --> 00:30:29.810
I just wanted to see

00:30:29.890 --> 00:30:32.980
Why is a family heirloom so fragile?

00:30:33.060 --> 00:30:34.390
Chan Wook!

00:30:38.110 --> 00:30:39.860
Let's talk. Here

00:30:40.530 --> 00:30:41.610
Uk

00:30:43.650 --> 00:30:44.780
Uk

00:30:46.620 --> 00:30:49.830
Hey Uk! Chan Wook!

00:30:54.540 --> 00:30:55.620
Uk!

00:30:56.960 --> 00:30:58.040
Uk!

00:30:58.670 --> 00:31:00.000
Chan Wook!

00:31:00.590 --> 00:31:01.960
Damn you!

00:31:03.300 --> 00:31:04.260
Uk!

00:31:05.470 --> 00:31:06.510
Pick up the pieces

00:31:06.590 --> 00:31:08.800
I'll have to put them back together

00:31:08.890 --> 00:31:10.180
- Yes, madam
- Yes, madam

00:31:25.400 --> 00:31:26.700
Moms

00:31:27.320 --> 00:31:29.160
Your master has done things

00:31:30.870 --> 00:31:33.540
That's how he saved me

00:31:33.620 --> 00:31:34.710
This guy...

00:31:34.790 --> 00:31:37.330
Last year I broke off my engagement with them

00:31:37.420 --> 00:31:39.840
This time I broke the relic

00:31:39.920 --> 00:31:42.170
- Engagement?
- Yes

00:31:43.380 --> 00:31:45.260
Canceled my wedding with her

00:31:45.920 --> 00:31:49.470
12 teachers abandoned him, the wedding fell through, and now this

00:31:49.550 --> 00:31:51.010
Walking trouble

00:31:53.770 --> 00:31:55.480
What will you do?

00:31:56.390 --> 00:31:57.560
Where is the owner?

00:31:58.560 --> 00:31:59.480
He was dragged away

00:32:00.150 --> 00:32:03.480
I'm afraid he will face a severe punishment this time.

00:32:10.910 --> 00:32:13.410
I sent you to Kisan

00:32:14.490 --> 00:32:16.710
You were thrown out of there within six months

00:32:17.540 --> 00:32:19.290
Why did you come here today?

00:32:19.370 --> 00:32:22.420
I heard that I caused trouble for you, so I came to apologize

00:32:23.000 --> 00:32:24.380
Is this your apology?

00:32:27.010 --> 00:32:29.890
Why did you break the urn?

00:32:29.970 --> 00:32:32.680
I was fascinated by it, I wanted to take a closer look,

00:32:32.760 --> 00:32:34.930
and he slipped out of my hands

00:32:35.020 --> 00:32:37.560
If I knew the spell, this wouldn't have happened

00:32:37.640 --> 00:32:39.100
I lack knowledge

00:32:39.190 --> 00:32:40.770
Chan Wook!

00:32:42.440 --> 00:32:44.270
He did the same

00:32:44.360 --> 00:32:46.530
with a door to a secret room. Destroyed it

00:32:47.030 --> 00:32:50.160
He did this on purpose. Out of envy

00:32:50.950 --> 00:32:54.030
This time I won't let you get away with it

00:32:54.990 --> 00:32:58.160
Until I allow it, Chan Wook is prohibited

00:32:58.250 --> 00:33:01.920
move or talk

00:33:03.250 --> 00:33:04.540
Repent

00:33:23.770 --> 00:33:24.770
Don't worry

00:33:26.230 --> 00:33:28.110
He won't be punished for long

00:33:29.650 --> 00:33:32.160
He almost died of a cold after his last punishment,

00:33:32.240 --> 00:33:33.370
was punished all day

00:33:34.280 --> 00:33:37.580
His gates of energy are opened just enough so that he does not die

00:33:37.660 --> 00:33:40.250
Extreme cold or heat can kill him

00:33:41.040 --> 00:33:42.250
And he's been sick for a long time

00:33:42.830 --> 00:33:46.710
Then open this gate. He wants it

00:33:47.340 --> 00:33:49.050
You are his friends

00:33:50.090 --> 00:33:51.970
We're too weak

00:33:53.300 --> 00:33:54.760
But no one in Sosnovy Bor...

00:33:54.850 --> 00:33:58.470
No, no one in Daeho would dare do this

00:34:03.690 --> 00:34:06.820
So he's been punished all his life

00:34:41.520 --> 00:34:43.560
You can drink hot tea

00:34:47.110 --> 00:34:48.230
Owner

00:34:48.860 --> 00:34:51.780
I'll go and leave you

00:34:53.360 --> 00:34:54.740
Are you leaving without me?

00:35:02.200 --> 00:35:04.580
You are loyal and know your responsibilities

00:35:05.460 --> 00:35:07.830
That's why you let me in, brought me here

00:35:08.920 --> 00:35:11.090
and defended

00:35:12.170 --> 00:35:15.470
You have to understand that you can't tell anyone about this.

00:35:28.360 --> 00:35:30.860
I'll be whole thanks to you

00:35:41.870 --> 00:35:44.870
The people I met wanted me dead

00:35:46.160 --> 00:35:48.040
You're the first to try

00:35:49.420 --> 00:35:51.040
save me

00:35:57.380 --> 00:36:00.010
Even if we find ourselves so close to each other again,

00:36:00.640 --> 00:36:02.180
I'll spare you

00:36:59.280 --> 00:37:02.160
I will send a gift to Kisan as an apology

00:37:02.240 --> 00:37:06.410
and pay a decent amount to the Jin family

00:37:07.000 --> 00:37:10.420
Uk made too many mistakes this time

00:37:11.960 --> 00:37:13.670
I had to punish him

00:37:13.750 --> 00:37:15.590
I'm glad you punished him

00:37:16.670 --> 00:37:19.970
Since you're done, I'll take it home

00:37:20.720 --> 00:37:21.890
Of course

00:37:23.600 --> 00:37:24.720
Thank you

00:37:30.640 --> 00:37:33.730
-Are you okay?
- Not okay

00:37:35.730 --> 00:37:37.940
Did Moo Deok come home?

00:37:38.530 --> 00:37:40.530
Why does she need it?

00:37:41.400 --> 00:37:45.080
Speaking of her, where was she when you were being punished?

00:37:45.700 --> 00:37:46.790
Forget

00:37:50.080 --> 00:37:52.960
Why did you ruin the door?

00:37:54.040 --> 00:37:55.630
The door won't close anymore

00:37:56.290 --> 00:37:57.630
I don't know

00:38:00.510 --> 00:38:03.010
- Why was the urn broken?
- I don't...

00:38:05.010 --> 00:38:06.600
I said, I don’t know

00:38:07.220 --> 00:38:08.560
Stop asking

00:38:18.650 --> 00:38:20.570
The firecrackers you asked for

00:38:20.650 --> 00:38:22.700
They will be visible very far away

00:38:25.740 --> 00:38:26.870
Okay

00:38:27.870 --> 00:38:30.830
Why do the master need them?

00:38:30.910 --> 00:38:33.290
Rumor has it that he was severely punished

00:38:33.370 --> 00:38:34.870
What is he up to this time?

00:38:36.880 --> 00:38:37.880
Secret

00:38:38.750 --> 00:38:40.550
Don't tell anyone about this

00:38:42.340 --> 00:38:43.590
Joo Wol

00:38:45.470 --> 00:38:47.510
It's better for him not to interfere anywhere

00:38:54.270 --> 00:38:55.650
This is the amulet of Sosnovy Bor

00:38:56.230 --> 00:38:58.110
Can you just go there?

00:38:58.190 --> 00:39:00.360
The young master trusts you a lot

00:39:01.110 --> 00:39:03.190
Such an expensive thing

00:39:04.280 --> 00:39:05.820
He wants me to sell him

00:39:06.740 --> 00:39:09.410
You can't just sell something like that

00:39:09.490 --> 00:39:10.490
How's that?

00:39:11.040 --> 00:39:13.330
He said there is such a place

00:39:13.910 --> 00:39:14.960
But there is

00:39:15.040 --> 00:39:18.420
there is one rich man who buys everything on the black market

00:39:20.000 --> 00:39:22.420
But getting there won't be easy

00:39:28.930 --> 00:39:31.060
You'll get a mountain of money

00:39:31.140 --> 00:39:33.060
Can I have some more chicken?

00:39:33.140 --> 00:39:35.730
Yes. I'll put it on your master's account

00:39:35.810 --> 00:39:37.730
Eat as much as you like

00:39:44.990 --> 00:39:49.280
Nak Soo's body is here, but his soul is elsewhere

00:39:50.160 --> 00:39:54.080
You will also be given new bodies by the alchemy of souls

00:39:54.160 --> 00:39:58.540
So don't be afraid to sacrifice yourself for me

00:39:58.630 --> 00:39:59.790
- Yes
- Yes

00:40:19.940 --> 00:40:20.860
Fire!

00:40:39.540 --> 00:40:41.040
I need my sword

00:40:41.130 --> 00:40:43.170
I'm weak because I migrated to another body

00:40:43.880 --> 00:40:46.800
I need my sword with energy to unleash your power

00:40:46.880 --> 00:40:49.510
Even if we find ourselves so close to each other again,

00:40:50.090 --> 00:40:51.590
I will spare you

00:40:56.390 --> 00:40:58.850
- Lost appetite
- Mister

00:41:01.060 --> 00:41:02.860
Mister, they've been caught

00:41:03.440 --> 00:41:06.110
- Moo Deok?
- Why catch her?

00:41:07.110 --> 00:41:09.240
Forget it

00:41:09.320 --> 00:41:11.030
Jin Moo, Deputy Chief of Jeonbugwan,

00:41:11.110 --> 00:41:13.530
caught Nak Su's people who entered Sosnovy Bor

00:41:14.160 --> 00:41:15.160
Really?

00:41:17.750 --> 00:41:21.620
Jin Mu delivered the bodies to the palace

00:41:21.710 --> 00:41:23.840
We caught Nak Soo

00:41:23.920 --> 00:41:26.710
I'm afraid they'll make us laugh

00:41:26.800 --> 00:41:29.800
It's true that he had no mercy

00:41:30.340 --> 00:41:32.010
no one?

00:41:32.090 --> 00:41:33.600
He killed everyone

00:41:35.100 --> 00:41:37.930
We can't trace the alchemy of souls

00:41:40.060 --> 00:41:42.400
Jin Ho Kyung from Jinyo Won is also here

00:41:47.530 --> 00:41:49.650
I heard Jin Moo

00:41:49.740 --> 00:41:52.530
caught the mercenaries that boron missed

00:41:53.360 --> 00:41:56.370
How did they break the Pine Forest barrier twice?

00:42:01.210 --> 00:42:03.460
There was a traitor in the forest

00:42:03.540 --> 00:42:06.840
Fortunately, Gwigu caught him

00:42:07.800 --> 00:42:09.090
Gwiga?

00:42:09.170 --> 00:42:11.050
I would like to see him too

00:42:11.130 --> 00:42:13.430
I'm afraid I can't show it to you now

00:42:13.510 --> 00:42:16.350
His ballot box was accidentally broken

00:42:17.430 --> 00:42:19.680
How could such a stupid mistake be made?

00:42:21.140 --> 00:42:22.390
Sorry, Your Majesty

00:42:23.440 --> 00:42:27.610
Since Jin Mu made such a contribution, I gathered you all to tell you about

00:42:27.690 --> 00:42:29.940
that I'm going to assign it to Gwangju

00:42:31.150 --> 00:42:32.400
It's impossible

00:42:32.490 --> 00:42:35.200
Chang Gang is still Gwangju

00:42:35.280 --> 00:42:38.280
The late king gave him a robe and a sword

00:42:38.370 --> 00:42:40.250
Jang Gang - Gwangju Jeonbugwan

00:42:40.830 --> 00:42:43.500
Plus, he has a son, Chan Wook.

00:42:43.580 --> 00:42:44.420
Chang Gan,

00:42:45.250 --> 00:42:46.630
hiding behind training,

00:42:46.710 --> 00:42:48.340
has been missing for decades

00:42:48.420 --> 00:42:51.460
His son Chang Wook is physically unable to cast spells

00:42:51.550 --> 00:42:53.550
Jin Moo, Deputy of Gwangju,

00:42:54.720 --> 00:42:55.800
fulfills his duties

00:42:57.640 --> 00:42:59.930
Your Majesty, spells related to dark magic,

00:43:00.010 --> 00:43:03.390
prohibited among magicians

00:43:03.480 --> 00:43:05.600
And the magicians of Sosnovy Bor always

00:43:06.150 --> 00:43:07.980
kept an eye on this

00:43:08.560 --> 00:43:12.070
Sosnovy Bor could have fallen to the bottom due to an incident with nomads

00:43:12.150 --> 00:43:13.610
They could have gotten rid of him

00:43:15.240 --> 00:43:19.120
But Jin Mu killed every single one of them

00:43:20.240 --> 00:43:22.700
In fact, he ruined everything

00:43:22.790 --> 00:43:24.410
You're upset

00:43:25.250 --> 00:43:28.080
because Jeonbugwan got all the glory?

00:43:28.170 --> 00:43:30.300
The magicians of Sosnovy Bor have captured Nak Su!

00:43:30.380 --> 00:43:32.260
But you took credit for this feat

00:43:34.590 --> 00:43:36.510
This is not what we came to discuss

00:43:39.010 --> 00:43:42.680
Regarding the Gwangju position, we will call a meeting of magicians

00:43:42.770 --> 00:43:45.770
and we will make a decision when Chang Gan returns

00:43:46.770 --> 00:43:49.900
Please reward him differently

00:43:53.400 --> 00:43:54.650
Jin Mu

00:43:56.610 --> 00:43:58.410
Tell me what you want

00:44:01.280 --> 00:44:03.200
People are worried about the spell

00:44:03.290 --> 00:44:05.710
Let me set Nak Soo's body on fire in front of Jeonbugwan

00:44:05.790 --> 00:44:06.960
And Nak Su's sword...

00:44:08.040 --> 00:44:11.380
Let us take him back, since Sosnovy Bor has already managed to lose him.

00:44:14.800 --> 00:44:16.510
That's what we'll do

00:44:25.730 --> 00:44:29.900
The best swords of magicians are kept

00:44:29.980 --> 00:44:32.730
at the Chongjingak Armory

00:44:33.860 --> 00:44:36.280
But now everything has changed

00:44:37.740 --> 00:44:39.910
Jin Moo from Jeonbugwan took Nak Soo's sword?

00:44:39.990 --> 00:44:43.580
Yes, he will bury Nak Soo's body there

00:44:43.660 --> 00:44:46.250
And she'll watch her body burn

00:44:46.330 --> 00:44:47.370
Who?

00:44:47.460 --> 00:44:48.370
Nak Soo?

00:44:49.120 --> 00:44:51.330
Do you still think that Nak Soo was able to change her body?

00:44:52.500 --> 00:44:55.000
Are you seriously thinking about asking to be her student?

00:44:56.170 --> 00:44:57.300
Forget it

00:44:58.220 --> 00:44:59.550
Pour me some more tea

00:45:02.550 --> 00:45:05.470
You also have hands,

00:45:05.560 --> 00:45:07.100
lazy

00:45:09.940 --> 00:45:12.480
Where is your maid Moo Deok?

00:45:13.860 --> 00:45:17.650
I'll find her, but first I need a sword

00:45:24.740 --> 00:45:27.330
Since he got rid of all my things,

00:45:27.830 --> 00:45:30.410
he probably thinks I died after not being able to find a new body

00:45:31.960 --> 00:45:34.840
Dan Zhu cannot be found. I don't know who he is

00:45:43.470 --> 00:45:46.220
Find a merchant who sells this painted amulet,

00:45:46.310 --> 00:45:47.720
and then you will find me

00:45:48.310 --> 00:45:49.600
I'll be waiting

00:46:12.330 --> 00:46:13.790
This is in Danhyangok

00:46:16.920 --> 00:46:20.420
Jeonbugwan

00:46:20.510 --> 00:46:22.220
I came for Nak Soo's sword

00:46:22.930 --> 00:46:24.220
Why do you need it?

00:46:24.300 --> 00:46:27.350
I heard His Majesty allowed him to be kept in Jeonbugwan

00:46:27.430 --> 00:46:30.930
Jang Gang - Gwangju, I think it would be right to give the sword to his family

00:46:31.020 --> 00:46:32.270
Since your father is not here,

00:46:32.350 --> 00:46:34.690
it would be better for Deputy Gwangju to keep it

00:46:38.150 --> 00:46:41.740
My father is not here, so I, his son, must keep him

00:46:46.450 --> 00:46:48.870
I heard you're looking everywhere for a teacher.

00:46:49.620 --> 00:46:51.330
I would like to receive you myself,

00:46:52.000 --> 00:46:54.710
but I can’t go against the will of your father, my teacher

00:46:56.380 --> 00:46:59.460
Why did he close the energy gate of his own son?

00:47:00.500 --> 00:47:02.380
I don't understand this at all

00:47:07.050 --> 00:47:09.470
The magician's energy flows through his sword

00:47:09.560 --> 00:47:13.640
An ordinary person like you won't be able to bare it

00:47:37.380 --> 00:47:39.170
Are you afraid that I will succeed?

00:47:42.090 --> 00:47:44.670
If I can, I'll be recognized as the next Gwangju

00:47:44.760 --> 00:47:47.640
This means you will not be able to apply for this position.

00:47:53.060 --> 00:47:54.100
Don't worry

00:47:54.890 --> 00:47:56.270
I can't do it yet

00:48:08.200 --> 00:48:09.410
Bye?

00:48:13.290 --> 00:48:15.960
I saw the lights above Danhyangok

00:48:16.040 --> 00:48:17.870
Are you sure he was from there?

00:48:17.960 --> 00:48:18.790
Yes

00:48:18.870 --> 00:48:21.420
It was above the valley, the former home of Nak Su

00:48:41.440 --> 00:48:43.070
I'm looking for a man with an amulet

00:48:52.530 --> 00:48:54.330
Madam, they have arrived

00:48:59.120 --> 00:49:00.880
I guess someone wants to buy it

00:49:06.460 --> 00:49:08.300
To you in the very last room

00:49:14.220 --> 00:49:16.020
How could you lose him?

00:49:16.100 --> 00:49:18.480
I didn't lose it, someone stole it

00:49:18.560 --> 00:49:20.060
I'm sure it was Ah Hyang

00:49:22.520 --> 00:49:24.520
Did you bring this?

00:49:27.030 --> 00:49:29.280
I came to buy the Sacred Amulet

00:49:30.110 --> 00:49:31.660
You've come to the right person

00:49:38.910 --> 00:49:40.710
It won't be useful anymore

00:49:40.790 --> 00:49:42.630
Kill her to avoid problems

00:49:55.050 --> 00:49:55.970
You know me, right?

00:49:56.060 --> 00:49:58.270
I told you to let me know if anyone brings this drawing.

00:49:58.930 --> 00:49:59.770
That's what I did

00:50:00.520 --> 00:50:02.730
She meets him upstairs

00:50:03.600 --> 00:50:05.860
So it was Ah Hyang

00:50:11.110 --> 00:50:12.660
We are magicians from Jeonbugwan

00:50:13.240 --> 00:50:16.450
We just caught a thief. Mind your own business

00:50:22.670 --> 00:50:23.830
He killed her

00:50:24.880 --> 00:50:26.420
He decided it was me

00:50:55.610 --> 00:50:57.780
Dan Zhu left me

00:51:25.140 --> 00:51:27.440
Is this really you?

00:51:32.150 --> 00:51:34.240
- Start
- Yes

00:52:00.550 --> 00:52:03.220
Chonbugwan caught Nak Su, but the magicians of the Pine Forest could not?

00:52:03.310 --> 00:52:05.680
Sosnovy Bor was humiliated

00:52:05.770 --> 00:52:09.190
There's a deputy in Gwangju

00:52:09.270 --> 00:52:10.230
Exactly

00:52:26.410 --> 00:52:28.420
So Dan Zhu is Jin Mu,

00:52:28.500 --> 00:52:32.170
Deputy of Gwangju Royal Jeonbugwan

00:52:44.470 --> 00:52:46.310
I'm burning

00:52:47.810 --> 00:52:52.150
Just like my house and parents burned down that day

00:52:58.450 --> 00:53:00.240
I'll give you strength

00:53:00.320 --> 00:53:02.030
Will you come with me?

00:53:40.200 --> 00:53:41.410
Owner

00:53:42.360 --> 00:53:44.950
As you can see, there's nothing I can do

00:53:45.740 --> 00:53:47.910
just watch my body burn

00:53:49.750 --> 00:53:51.710
I can't help you either

00:53:59.010 --> 00:54:00.340
I found your sword

00:54:07.850 --> 00:54:10.180
You said you could get your power back if you got your sword

00:54:17.190 --> 00:54:20.240
Why did you get up? Come on, try to bare it

00:54:38.170 --> 00:54:40.710
The unsurpassed sword recognizes its owner

00:54:50.850 --> 00:54:53.560
Now I need to accept his energy

00:55:30.140 --> 00:55:32.390
You're too weak to bare

00:55:33.480 --> 00:55:34.940
your own sword

00:55:37.310 --> 00:55:39.150
You're as powerless as I am

00:55:40.150 --> 00:55:41.440
We are useless

00:55:46.740 --> 00:55:49.280
Enough, forget it

00:55:49.990 --> 00:55:51.120
Go away

00:55:56.830 --> 00:56:00.670
I doubt you're a threat to Sosnovy Bor, and Nak Su is already dead.

00:56:02.000 --> 00:56:04.130
Live like Moo Deok

00:56:09.010 --> 00:56:10.680
I'd rather die

00:56:14.850 --> 00:56:16.270
how am I going to live like this?

00:56:18.810 --> 00:56:20.480
Then die!

00:57:12.660 --> 00:57:14.620
This is the grave of the nomadic soul swallowers

00:57:15.700 --> 00:57:18.210
The one who taught me this spell,

00:57:18.290 --> 00:57:20.830
got rid of bodies here

00:57:31.760 --> 00:57:32.890
So it will become

00:57:34.300 --> 00:57:36.140
and my grave too

00:58:03.880 --> 00:58:07.590
Sir, when can we open this place?

00:58:08.960 --> 00:58:10.300
I'm already done

00:58:10.970 --> 00:58:12.680
What happened to Moo Deok?

00:58:12.760 --> 00:58:14.430
She seems lost

00:58:18.640 --> 00:58:19.890
I'm just worried

00:58:20.810 --> 00:58:23.100
She went to Gyeongjeongdaeho Lake

00:58:25.860 --> 00:58:27.020
Lake Gyeongcheongdaeho?

00:58:30.320 --> 00:58:31.990
I'd rather die

00:58:33.780 --> 00:58:34.990
how am I going to live like this?

00:58:35.070 --> 00:58:36.530
Then die!

00:59:50.190 --> 00:59:51.320
Moo Dok!

00:59:52.280 --> 00:59:53.360
Moo Dok!

01:00:57.380 --> 01:01:00.840
Sejukwon, Sosnovy Bor

01:01:11.310 --> 01:01:12.770
You're in Saejukwon

01:01:13.730 --> 01:01:15.530
In the hospital of master Ho Yeom in Sosnovy Bor

01:01:16.650 --> 01:01:19.610
I was only allowed in here because of you.

01:01:22.320 --> 01:01:25.700
Do your eyes hurt? I gave you drops

01:01:26.580 --> 01:01:29.540
He said the blue spots in your eyes are like bruises

01:01:29.620 --> 01:01:32.170
These drops will lighten their color

01:01:32.790 --> 01:01:33.880
Drip them constantly

01:01:41.760 --> 01:01:43.390
I drew my sword

01:01:45.140 --> 01:01:46.260
I really did it

01:01:46.350 --> 01:01:47.850
I know I saw

01:01:48.600 --> 01:01:50.390
But you're still weak

01:01:50.480 --> 01:01:52.730
You only succeeded thanks to the energy of the lake

01:01:54.110 --> 01:01:56.150
My strength returned when I was in the lake

01:01:57.780 --> 01:01:59.070
I have to go back there

01:01:59.150 --> 01:02:02.610
And? Will you live underwater like a fish?

01:02:08.080 --> 01:02:11.210
I felt a surge of energy underwater

01:02:11.290 --> 01:02:12.920
This is how I got my power back

01:02:13.500 --> 01:02:14.670
This is it

01:02:15.750 --> 01:02:18.210
A man whose energy is as strong as a lake's

01:02:18.880 --> 01:02:21.630
should awaken the energy in me

01:02:21.720 --> 01:02:24.550
And who is it? Will you also look for a teacher?

01:02:25.220 --> 01:02:28.390
Do you think there is anyone that strong?

01:02:28.470 --> 01:02:31.440
Even if he does, will he want to help you?

01:02:32.600 --> 01:02:34.270
You are Nak Soo, a mercenary who moves from body to body.

01:02:37.770 --> 01:02:38.690
What?

01:02:38.780 --> 01:02:41.360
Wook in Saejukwon?

01:02:41.950 --> 01:02:44.110
He came to show the wounded maid

01:02:44.200 --> 01:02:45.870
He broke into our place

01:02:45.950 --> 01:02:47.080
A maid?

01:02:48.490 --> 01:02:49.910
Moo Deok, I think?

01:02:50.000 --> 01:02:51.460
How badly she got hurt

01:02:52.000 --> 01:02:54.920
that he had to come here himself?

01:03:11.060 --> 01:03:13.190
I've only heard about Saejukwon

01:03:14.020 --> 01:03:15.650
Truly an amazing hospital

01:03:16.810 --> 01:03:18.650
Full of medicinal herbs

01:03:19.270 --> 01:03:20.690
Like poisonous ones

01:03:26.450 --> 01:03:30.200
These drops will make your eye color normal

01:03:30.290 --> 01:03:31.830
Lay low, live like Moo Deok

01:03:32.700 --> 01:03:34.210
That's all I can do for you

01:03:34.290 --> 01:03:35.580
You're wrong

01:03:36.750 --> 01:03:39.290
I want you to be my Gyeongjeongdaeho Lake

01:03:42.710 --> 01:03:45.380
You said that you risked your life more than once for me.

01:03:46.640 --> 01:03:48.350
Take another risk

01:03:54.810 --> 01:03:56.100
It will hurt

01:04:03.490 --> 01:04:04.860
What did you add here?

01:04:07.200 --> 01:04:09.200
One poisonous plant

01:04:16.000 --> 01:04:17.790
I bet everything on you

01:04:19.880 --> 01:04:22.840
I hope you survive

01:04:39.310 --> 01:04:40.610
If you can

01:04:43.940 --> 01:04:45.900
I will become your teacher

01:04:55.750 --> 01:04:57.370
Uk!

01:04:58.330 --> 01:05:00.380
What's happened? Uk

01:05:00.460 --> 01:05:01.540
Uk!

01:05:01.630 --> 01:05:02.920
What happened to him?

01:05:03.550 --> 01:05:04.670
He drank poison

01:05:06.380 --> 01:05:07.880
- Poison?
- Which?

01:05:07.970 --> 01:05:11.510
His heart will stop in six hours

01:05:11.600 --> 01:05:12.760
What kind of poison is this?

01:05:12.850 --> 01:05:15.270
Until you understand and prepare the antidote,

01:05:15.350 --> 01:05:17.100
it will be too late

01:05:17.180 --> 01:05:19.730
There's only one way to save him

01:05:19.810 --> 01:05:21.150
Open the gates of his energy

01:05:21.230 --> 01:05:24.820
and get rid of the poison on your own

01:05:24.900 --> 01:05:26.110
What?

01:05:27.610 --> 01:05:29.280
Open the gates of his energy

01:05:29.900 --> 01:05:31.490
Otherwise he will die

01:05:35.160 --> 01:05:36.950
Yu-yu-yul...

01:05:37.700 --> 01:05:39.460
U-uk drank poison

01:05:40.290 --> 01:05:41.540
They say he will die

01:05:41.630 --> 01:05:44.460
- What?
- Moo Deok gave him poison

01:05:44.540 --> 01:05:46.920
But she doesn't say which one,

01:05:47.010 --> 01:05:49.800
that's why her uncle is torturing her now

01:05:55.470 --> 01:05:57.060
What kind of poison is this?

01:06:01.390 --> 01:06:03.150
Carry on

01:06:03.230 --> 01:06:05.610
- She might die
- Uk is dying right now

01:06:06.360 --> 01:06:10.030
We must know the name of the poison within two hours.

01:06:16.450 --> 01:06:17.540
Mister Chan

01:06:18.370 --> 01:06:19.500
Mister...

01:06:21.580 --> 01:06:22.790
Open the gate

01:06:24.000 --> 01:06:25.880
It's the only way

01:06:28.340 --> 01:06:29.760
We don't have time!

01:06:30.380 --> 01:06:31.510
Mister...

01:06:32.510 --> 01:06:34.590
Please save our master!

01:06:49.320 --> 01:06:50.780
- Mister
- How's Uk?

01:06:50.860 --> 01:06:52.490
Did something happen?

01:06:52.570 --> 01:06:54.490
Masteo Ho Yeom removed the poison

01:06:55.120 --> 01:06:56.620
Mister Chan is safe

01:06:57.200 --> 01:06:59.790
- Has he prepared an antidote?
- No

01:07:00.540 --> 01:07:03.620
He opened the gates of his energy

01:07:29.190 --> 01:07:31.990
Sir, are you awake?

01:07:44.120 --> 01:07:46.040
Am I alive or dead?

01:07:47.290 --> 01:07:49.000
You barely survived

01:07:49.090 --> 01:07:50.630
Master Ho Yeom saved you

01:07:51.760 --> 01:07:54.010
opening the gates of energy

01:07:56.430 --> 01:07:58.090
Did he open them?

01:07:58.180 --> 01:07:59.640
That crazy Moo Deok

01:08:00.350 --> 01:08:03.350
I didn’t say what poison I gave you

01:08:03.430 --> 01:08:07.230
So he had no other choice

01:08:11.320 --> 01:08:13.570
I bet everything on you

01:08:14.190 --> 01:08:17.360
I hope you survive

01:08:20.370 --> 01:08:21.790
Where is Moo Deok?

01:08:40.800 --> 01:08:41.930
Moo Deok...

01:08:48.600 --> 01:08:49.850
Moo Dok!

01:09:00.410 --> 01:09:01.370
Moo Deok

01:09:04.870 --> 01:09:06.040
Moo Deok

01:09:10.540 --> 01:09:11.630
Moo Deok

01:09:26.220 --> 01:09:27.930
We both could have died

01:09:28.810 --> 01:09:29.940
You...

01:09:31.270 --> 01:09:32.610
really crazy

01:09:35.780 --> 01:09:37.280
So you survived

01:09:39.030 --> 01:09:40.410
my student

01:09:46.700 --> 01:09:47.950
Yes

01:09:49.870 --> 01:09:51.670
I almost died thanks to you

01:09:58.210 --> 01:09:59.970
my crazy teacher

01:10:47.520 --> 01:10:50.720
/////////////////////////////////////

01:10:55.720 --> 01:10:58.920
Thanks for watching with us!
doramamania

01:11:07.420 --> 01:11:10.360
Alchemy

01:11:07.420 --> 01:11:10.360
Shower

01:11:10.910 --> 01:11:15.040
As a result, Uk opened the gates of his energy

01:11:15.120 --> 01:11:18.920
Since I survived as promised, I will treat you as my teacher

01:11:19.000 --> 01:11:22.590
To become a better magician, you must go through several stages

01:11:22.670 --> 01:11:25.050
You're worse than I imagined

01:11:25.130 --> 01:11:26.390
We looked at Yulia

01:11:26.470 --> 01:11:27.760
Moo Deok asked me to come

01:11:27.850 --> 01:11:29.510
This girl, Moo Deok...

01:11:29.600 --> 01:11:31.810
She seems to be hiding something

01:11:31.890 --> 01:11:33.640
I love you!

01:11:33.730 --> 01:11:37.730
Sir, the Crown Prince has come to see you.

01:11:37.810 --> 01:11:40.020
There's another sword here that you can't draw

01:11:40.110 --> 01:11:42.440
It doesn't bode well for me if I lose this sword too.

01:11:42.530 --> 01:11:43.360
There's nothing to be done

01:11:43.440 --> 01:11:45.360
Whoever wins takes the sword
